        "summary":  "IBM announced self-hosted deployment capabilities for its Bob agentic software development platform, enabling enterprises to run the technology on-premises, in private cloud, or sovereign cloud environments. The expansion addresses growing governance and security concerns among IT leaders, particularly for organizations managing regulated data and sensitive source code. The move reflects broader industry trends toward hybrid cloud approaches and increased focus on AI agent oversight.",
